.DS_Store

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEVER COMMIT A DATABASE DUMP.
#
# This repository is PUBLIC. Today the database holds one therapist; after the
# first real client it holds an email address beside a reason for seeking
# therapy, which is PHI. GitHub does not sign a BAA on Free, Pro or Team --
# only through GitHub Enterprise Cloud on a Microsoft Enterprise Agreement --
# so PHI landing in here is not "untidy", it is a disclosure to a vendor with
# no agreement covering it, and git history makes it permanent.
#
# This matters right now: the ca-central-1 to us-east-1 migration dumps the
# database, and HQ's deploy.sh runs `git add -A`. A dump left in this
# directory would be committed and published without anyone deciding to.
#
# The leading slash confines these to the repo root, so the real migrations
# under supabase/migrations/ are still tracked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/*.sql
/*.dump
/*.backup
/*.csv
dumps/
backups/

# Secrets live in Edge Function environment, never in the tree.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
